# phenoEnrichR cleaned full R script
# Purpose: HPO and MP phenotype enrichment from user-supplied genes
#
# What tsource('~/Downloads/full_clean_phenoEnrichR_with_comparisons.R', chdir = TRUE)his script includes:
# - HPO enrichment
# - MP enrichment using human-mouse orthologues and MGI annotations
# - Ontology parsing from OBO files
# - Ontology propagation to account for hierarchy
# - Fisher enrichment + FDR correction
# - Results table
# - Bar plot
# - Bubble plot
# - Background universe comparison
# - Flat vs propagated vs simple pruning comparison
#
# What this script does NOT include:
